  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「ペン太しゃん、ゴン太しゃん。すこし早いけど、お昼ご飯だぞ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「今日はお客さんがくるがらなぁ、ドタバタしちゃうと思うだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「ふたりに餌をあげる暇がないがもしれねぇがら、早めのお昼ご飯だぁ。おいで、おいで♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「んあっ、跳びついてきちゃ困るだよ。ペン太しゃん、犬とはいえ『でっけぇ』んだがら」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「たぶん、おらと同じぐらい体重あるだろ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「引っくりかえっちまうだよ、おら料理ちゅうだがら危ねぇだよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「はい、お昼ご飯だぁ。早い時間だがら、すくなめでごめんなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「お客さんたちが、おまえらに餌やりたがるかもしれねぇしな♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「えへ。ゴン太しゃん、もりもり食べでペン太しゃんみたいに『でっかく』なるだぞ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「ん？　どうしたんだぁ、ペン太しゃん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「もう食べ終わっちまっだのがぁ、いつもペロリと平らげちまうな♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「すくなめの量だったがら、物足りながったがな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「そんなに尻尾を振っちゃって……お菓子とか、ほしいのが？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「でもなぁ。ペン太しゃんにお菓子をあげだら、ゴン太しゃんもほしがるだろ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「ゴン太しゃん、ペン太しゃんより『ちいせぇ』がら。同じだけ食べたら、身体によぐねぇだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「わがるな、ペン太しゃんのほうが『おとな』なんだがら我慢できるな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「胃袋がパンクしちまうだ、オェってなっちまうだよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「よしよし。聞き分けがよぐで助かるだよ、つばさしゃんの躾がよかったんだろうなぁ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「最初は、『でっけぇ犬』なんて怖かっだげど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「今では、ペン太しゃんもゴン太しゃんもおらの大事な家族だぁ。もちろん、つばさしゃんも♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「んあ、ゴン太しゃんも食べ終わっだなぁ。それじゃあ、つばさしゃんを起こしてきてぐれる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-apron",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-apron_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「おら、ふたりが食べ終えたお皿を洗ってるがら。よろしぐなぁ、敬礼～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「～♪」"
  },
